espeak-ng: Required for text-to-speech voice output.

pipewire-audio: Provides wpctl for controlling system volume.

playerctl: Controls media playback (play/pause, skip) for browsers and media players.

portaudio: Required by PyAudio to capture microphone input.

cpupower: Manages CPU performance modes (performance vs powersave).

kitty & cava: Terminal emulator and visualizer triggered by the toggle_cava command.
